WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
There are over 50 years of Friday
night lights in this place.

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.884
Many have gone on to the next level,

3
00:00:05.884 --> 00:00:09.400
some even to the NFL,
but they all started right here.

4
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.431
This program has 25 state championships,

5
00:00:12.431 --> 00:00:15.300
the most of any other
program in Mississippi.

6
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.274
The history, the sacrifice,
the joy, and yes, the heartbreak,

7
00:00:20.274 --> 00:00:24.380
have fueled a brotherhood that
stretches across generations.

8
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:30.100
When you step between these lines with Prep
on your helmet, you represent us all.

9
00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:39.600
[Music]

10
00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:50.300
[TV clip from Breaking Bad: Walter
White's "I am the one who knocks" speech]

11
00:00:50.500 --> 00:01:58.500
[Music]

12
00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.400
[Announcer] Touchdown, Wayne Smith.

13
00:02:04.620 --> 00:02:07.900
That's Owen Brown leading
the charge for the Patriots.

14
00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.100
I don't think they know what's
about to take this field out there.

15
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:12.600
I don't think anybody knows
what's about to take this field.

16
00:02:12.800 --> 00:02:30.300
[Music]
